nasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄长儿韵语 其三","author":"杨士奇","text":"闻说谀言得尔欢，忠言谁肯竭心肝。\n从今勉受贤人爱，莫把忠言反意看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3619,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄长儿韵语 其四","author":"杨士奇","text":"责善辅仁为益友，谄言谗说是凶俦。\n益友深交儗金石，凶俦远避似戈矛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3620,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄长儿韵语 其五","author":"杨士奇","text":"种禾必用薅稂莠，岂有薰莸可共藏。\n吾儿尽绝谗谀侣，即起芳名致福祥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3621,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄长儿韵语 其六","author":"杨士奇","text":"已足当休即便休，百年何用万年谋。\n人人自带生来福，枉为儿孙作马牛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3622,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]